OL,5,G1200 The Phone In
OL,6,     FYour reflections on the Aberfan
OL,7,     Fdisaster 60 years on. Does the
OL,8,     Fcouncil tax system in Wales need
OL,9,     Fto be changed? And Ali G is back,
OL,10,     Fbut is the character past its
OL,11,     Fsell-by date?
OL,12,G1400 Behnaz Akhgar
OL,13,     FTexas legend Sharleen Spiteri
OL,14,     Fdiscusses new music, a 30th
OL,15,     Fanniversary celebration and the
OL,16,     Fband's return to Cardiff, plus
OL,17,     Fchef John Chantarasak shares two
OL,18,     Fdelicious recipes.
OL,19,G1700 Radio Wales Drive
OL,20,     FEverything you need to know as you
OL,21,     Fhead home.
